Audio Duration: 5m 9.1s (309.08s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 11:25:05 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.98)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,660] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 9  | Text: 很多什么客人我都认识过
Segment #2   [00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:03,520] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为我代价做了几年了是吧
Segment #3   [00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,200] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 3  | Text: 几年了
Segment #4   [00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,120] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 做了六年多了
Segment #5   [00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:09,640] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 14 | Text: 原来有的客人喝酒的骂人的也有
Segment #6   [00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,940] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 就打人的就
Segment #7   [00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,260] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 我就被客人打过
Segment #8   [00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,620] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说你看我的额头
Segment #9   [00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,200] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 有老婆看我的额头
Segment #10  [00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,660] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 看那打人是什么
Segment #11  [00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:20,860] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 3  | Text: 你要有时候
Segment #12  [00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,620] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 他客人喝多了
Segment #13  [00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,640] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 一句话两句话
Segment #14  [00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:24,460] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 你也不是说
Segment #15  [00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,380] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是说一句话两句话
Segment #16  [00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:26,940] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 他就听着
Segment #17  [00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,600] | Elapsed:  12.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就说你多嘴了
Segment #18  [00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,180] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 就品牌物都打你
Segment #19  [00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,560] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是说很平常
Segment #20  [00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:32,600] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是你说我为什么
Segment #21  [00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,160] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 今天让你上来
Segment #22  [00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,780] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 不过我是先给你的钱
Segment #23  [00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:36,820] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后又让你上来
Segment #24  [00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,740] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 没有任何别的意思
Segment #25  [00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,020] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 上来之前我就讲了
Segment #26  [00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,660] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 11 | Text: 我说我们从来不是为难别人的人
Segment #27  [00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:45,660] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 11 | Text: 只是因为我们曾经对别人为难过
Segment #28  [00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:48,120] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 你要说你家里还有人在等你
Segment #29  [00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:48,860] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 3  | Text: 那你就回去
Segment #30  [00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:49,480] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 3  | Text: 那是什么
Segment #31  [00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:49,960] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 你还说没有人
Segment #32  [00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,260] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 反正现在还不到收工的时间
Segment #33  [00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:51,820] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 2  | Text: 没事没事
Segment #34  [00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:52,860] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 那你就上来
Segment #35  [00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:53,900] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是在你上来之前
Segment #36  [00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:54,800] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 站在我的角度
Segment #37  [00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,240] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 我不会让你把他上来
Segment #38  [00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:57,340] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 2  | Text: 知道了
Segment #39  [00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:58,100] | Elapsed:  28.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 你也太客气了吧
Segment #40  [00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,180] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 4  | Text: 不是我客气
Segment #41  [00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:00,400] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 1  | Text: 这个
Segment #42  [00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,740] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 7  | Text: 我没有任何别的意思
Segment #43  [00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:02,960] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是你也是一种缆分
Segment #44  [00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:03,140] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #45  [00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,560] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 9  | Text: 他跟代价也是一种缆分
Segment #46  [00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:04,780] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #47  [00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:05,320] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 2  | Text: 不是不是
Segment #48  [00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:07,320] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 我想给你拿的意思是什么
Segment #49  [00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:08,140] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 4  | Text: 就一句话
Segment #50  [00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,220] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 6  | Text: 盖活中心思想
Segment #51  [00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:11,120] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 2  | Text: 就是现在
Segment #52  [00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:15,740] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 明天有可能我是你的代价
Segment #53  [00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:16,560] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 1  | Text: 现在
Segment #54  [00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:18,280] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 6  | Text: 现在的东西很虚
Segment #55  [00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,580] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 10 | Text: 花无本日红人无本日红
Segment #56  [00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:26,300] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 10 | Text: 花无本日红人无本日红
Segment #57  [00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:27,060] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 4  | Text: 就现在你可能
Segment #58  [00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:27,560] | Elapsed:  43.47s | Words: 2  | Text: 你看我
Segment #59  [00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,480] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 你感觉
Segment #60  [00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,840] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个小伙子长得很帅
Segment #61  [00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,740] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 很有魅力
Segment #62  [00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,900] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后现在也没喝醉
Segment #63  [00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:35,040] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后站在我的角度
Segment #64  [00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,240] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 就像你刚刚跟我说的一样
Segment #65  [00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:38,220] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 说自己并不努力的人
Segment #66  [00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:39,280] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定特别努力
Segment #67  [00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:41,040] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 说自己并不优秀的人
Segment #68  [00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,100] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定特别优秀
Segment #69  [00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,200] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 2  | Text: 说自己
Segment #70  [00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,200] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 并不能喝的人
Segment #71  [00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,120] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定特别努力
Segment #72  [00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:50,020] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 然后我想表达的意思是什么
Segment #73  [00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:51,180] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们什么都不差
Segment #74  [00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:53,080] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 我们只欠缺一个机会
Segment #75  [00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:53,940] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 我说我
Segment #76  [00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:56,540] | Elapsed:  59.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 我欠缺四里
Segment #77  [00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:59,200] | Elapsed:  74.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 是有时候就是机会没保护住
Segment #78  [00:01:59,200 --> 00:01:59,700] | Elapsed:  74.21s | Words: 2  | Text: 是吧
Segment #79  [00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:00,420] | Elapsed:  74.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 有时候机会来了
Segment #80  [00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,420] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 把他都凑过了
Segment #81  [00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:02,180] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 就算凑过了
Segment #82  [00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,040] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 1  | Text: 就是
Segment #83  [00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:06,260] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 像咱们来了做代价
Segment #84  [00:02:06,660 --> 00:02:07,540] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 做了几年
Segment #85  [00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:08,280] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 2  | Text: 也就是
Segment #86  [00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:09,620] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 2  | Text: 哎呀
Segment #87  [00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:11,800] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 我想你是为什么来的出海
Segment #88  [00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,400] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是有亲戚在这边打工啊
Segment #89  [00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,760] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是说看这边
Segment #90  [00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:19,020] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们在这边打工
Segment #91  [00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:20,520] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是有这边有亲人吗
Segment #92  [00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,040] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 3  | Text: 联系吗
Segment #93  [00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,560] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是说这边打工
Segment #94  [00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,600] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 肯定比老家好一点
Segment #95  [00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:25,980] | Elapsed:  74.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 现在一个月可以搞多久
Segment #96  [00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:27,140] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 我不用你借钱
Segment #97  [00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:27,960] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 2  | Text: 我知道
Segment #98  [00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,880] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 下了一个月
Segment #99  [00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:30,440] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要做钱子的
Segment #100 [00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,220] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 3  | Text: 啊 钱子
Segment #101 [00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:32,700] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是说没有上班
Segment #102 [00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:34,860] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 每天睡觉夜晚做的
Segment #103 [00:02:34,860 --> 00:02:36,220] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果生意好的话呢
Segment #104 [00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:37,340] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是一万块钱左右
Segment #105 [00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:38,520] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 生意差呢
Segment #106 [00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,660] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是六七千块钱
Segment #107 [00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:41,000] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 1  | Text: 就是
Segment #108 [00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,560] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是不一定
Segment #109 [00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,800] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们这就是灵活的
Segment #110 [00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,720] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是说没固定的
Segment #111 [00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:48,000] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是生意好的就是一万块钱
Segment #112 [00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,640] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 生意不好也就是六七千块钱
Segment #113 [00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,340] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 七八千块钱
Segment #114 [00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:51,720] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 2  | Text: 就是这样
Segment #115 [00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,680] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 9  | Text: 平时的话就是七八千块钱
Segment #116 [00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,500] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是平下来
Segment #117 [00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:55,820] | Elapsed:  90.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 平时的话就是这样
